{"id":9302,"slug":"oficina-de-deportes-realizo-capacitacion-en-primeros-auxilios-para-monitores-y-funcionarios","title":"Oficina de Deportes realizó capacitación en primeros auxilios para monitores y funcionarios","date":"2026-06-02T23:20:35","excerpt":"Con el objetivo de fortalecer la preparación ante situaciones de emergencia durante actividades deportivas, la Oficina de Deportes de la Municipalidad de Maullín organizó una capacitación en primeros auxilios dirigida a monitores deportivos y funcionarios vinculados al área. La jornada permitió entregar conocimientos y herramientas prácticas para actuar de manera oportuna frente a distintos tipos […]","categories":[{"id":33,"name":"Innovación","slug":"innovacion"},{"id":179,"name":"Agrupaciones Comunitarias","slug":"agrupaciones-comunitarias"},{"id":10,"name":"Cultura/Comunidad","slug":"cultura-comunidad"},{"id":12,"name":"Deporte","slug":"deporte"},{"id":1,"name":"Proyectos","slug":"proyectos"},{"id":14,"name":"Salud","slug":"salud"}],"author":"Redacción Último Bastión","image":"/images/posts/9302.webp","content":"<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Con el objetivo de fortalecer la preparación ante situaciones de emergencia durante actividades deportivas, la Oficina de Deportes de la Municipalidad de Maullín organizó una capacitación en primeros auxilios dirigida a monitores deportivos y funcionarios vinculados al área.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">La jornada permitió entregar conocimientos y herramientas prácticas para actuar de manera oportuna frente a distintos tipos de emergencias, contribuyendo a brindar una mayor seguridad a niños, jóvenes y adultos que participan en talleres y actividades deportivas comunales.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Entre los contenidos abordados destacaron:</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Manejo de trauma en extremidades.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Trauma craneano.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Trauma torácico.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Manejo de heridas.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Uso y manejo de DEA (Desfibrilador Externo Automático).</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"✅\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\"/> Manejo de PCR (Paro Cardiorrespiratorio).</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Desde la Oficina de Deportes agradecieron especialmente el apoyo y colaboración de la Segunda Compañía de Bomberos, cuyos voluntarios compartieron sus conocimientos y experiencia, permitiendo fortalecer las capacidades de quienes trabajan diariamente en el desarrollo del deporte comunal.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><img alt=\"👏\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tfe/1/16/1f44f.png\"/> Estas instancias son fundamentales para contar con equipos mejor preparados y capacitados para enfrentar cualquier situación de emergencia que pueda presentarse durante la práctica deportiva.</p>\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fuente comunicaciones munimaullin.cl</p>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped wp-block-gallery-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9306\" data-id=\"9306\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-01-1024x683.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-01-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-01-300x200.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-01-768x512.jpg 768w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-01-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-01-2048x1366.jpg 2048w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9309\" data-id=\"9309\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-02-1024x683.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-02-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-02-300x200.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-02-768x512.jpg 768w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-02-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-02-2048x1366.jpg 2048w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9304\" data-id=\"9304\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-04-1024x683.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-04-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-04-300x200.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-04-768x512.jpg 768w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-04-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-04-2048x1366.jpg 2048w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9305\" data-id=\"9305\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-05-1024x683.jpg\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-05-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-05-300x200.jpg 300w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-05-768x512.jpg 768w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-05-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.cl/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/rcp-05-2048x1366.jpg 2048w\"/></figure>\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-9307\" data-id=\"9307\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" onerror=\"this.onerror=null; (this.closest('figure') || this).style.display='none';\" src=\"https://i0.wp.com/maullinultimobastion.c